---
layout: layouts/home.njk
description: Personal workbench and writing index of Kartikey Chauhan. Senior Data Analyst at McAfee, exploring analytics, local AI, and homelabs.
language: en
ogLocale: en_CA
---
{% from "components/feed-card.njk" import postListRow %}
{% from "components/authorship-badge.njk" import authorshipBadge %}

{% set logTypes = ['note', 'snippet', 'til', 'quotation'] %}

<div class="home-index-shell not-prose">
  <section class="home-intro-grid animate-enter">
    <div class="home-intro-main">
      <div class="home-avatar-shell shrink-0">
        <img src="{{ '/img/headshot-halftone.svg' | url }}" alt="Kartikey Chauhan" width="320" height="320" loading="eager" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="home-eyebrow">ANALYTICS / LOCAL AI / HOMELABS / INTERNET ARCHIVES</p>
        <h1 class="home-title"><span class="home-title-lead">Hi<span class="home-title-comma">,</span> I’m</span> <span class="home-title-accent">Kartikey.</span></h1>
        <p class="home-dek">
          Data analyst in Toronto. I write about analytics, local AI, homelabs, personal systems, and internet archives.
        </p>
        <p class="home-dek home-dek-muted">
          Grab a coffee and look around.
        </p>

        <div class="home-link-row">
          <a href="/about/">About</a>
          <a href="/now/">Now</a>
          <a href="/ai/">AI</a>
          <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>
          <a href="/blog/">Writing</a>
          <a href="/notes/">Log</a>
          <a href="/cv/">CV</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/carteakey" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-recent-panel home-recent-panel-primary animate-enter stagger-1">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start">

      {# ── Left Column (7 cols): Flagship Series, Folios & Essays ── #}
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <div class="home-panel-head">
            <p class="home-panel-kicker">Research Series & Folios</p>
            <a href="/ai/" class="home-panel-link">AI Workbench →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
            <a href="/blog/local-inference/" class="surface surface-compact surface-hover block no-underline group">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span class="editorial-kicker">Series · 14 Posts</span>
                <span class="meta-text">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="editorial-title-compact mt-1 mb-0.5 title-hover">Local Inference on 12GB VRAM</p>
              <p class="editorial-support-compact m-0">125B MoE offloading, Strata dynamic expert caches, and llama.cpp benchmarks.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/folio/model-tier-list/" class="surface surface-compact surface-hover block no-underline group">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span class="editorial-kicker">Interactive Folio</span>
                <span class="meta-text">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="editorial-title-compact mt-1 mb-0.5 title-hover">Coding & Agent Model Tier List</p>
              <p class="editorial-support-compact m-0">18 active frontier and open-weight models ranked with API pricing math.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/blog/agents/" class="surface surface-compact surface-hover block no-underline group">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span class="editorial-kicker">Series · 8 Posts</span>
                <span class="meta-text">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="editorial-title-compact mt-1 mb-0.5 title-hover">Autonomous Coding Agents</p>
              <p class="editorial-support-compact m-0">Multi-agent orchestration, Claude Code, Codex CLI, and burner reviewers.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/blog/sortling/" class="surface surface-compact surface-hover block no-underline group">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span class="editorial-kicker">Series · 3 Posts</span>
                <span class="meta-text">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="editorial-title-compact mt-1 mb-0.5 title-hover">Sortling & Media Triage</p>
              <p class="editorial-support-compact m-0">Killing junk WhatsApp forwards and routing media with local vision models.</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="home-panel-head">
            <p class="home-panel-kicker">Essays & Long-form Writing</p>
            <a href="/blog/" class="home-panel-link">All {{ collections.posts | length }} essays →</a>
          </div>

          <ul class="feed-list list-none m-0 p-0">
            {% for post in collections.pinnedPosts | head(3) %}
              {{ postListRow(post, collections.feed, {}) }}
            {% endfor %}
            {% set recentCount = 0 %}
            {% for post in collections.posts | sortByDate %}
              {% if not post.data.pinned and recentCount < 6 %}
                {% set recentCount = recentCount + 1 %}
                {{ postListRow(post, collections.feed, {}) }}
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ── Right Column (5 cols): The Live Lab Log ── #}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="home-panel-head">
          <p class="home-panel-kicker">The Lab Log · Notes, Code & TIL</p>
          <a href="/notes/" class="home-panel-link">Full log →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="surface divide-y divide-gray-200/70 dark:divide-gray-800/70">
          {% set logShown = 0 %}
          {% for item in collections.feed %}
            {% if item.type in logTypes and logShown < 9 %}
              {% set logShown = logShown + 1 %}
              <article class="p-3.5 group" {% if item.authored_by %}data-authored-by="{{ item.authored_by }}"{% endif %}>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                  <span class="badge badge-type badge-compact badge-type-{{ item.type }}">
                    {% if item.type == 'note' %}Note{% elif item.type == 'snippet' %}Snippet{% elif item.type == 'til' %}TIL{% else %}Quote{% endif %}
                  </span>
                  <time datetime="{{ item.date | htmlDateString }}" class="meta-text">{{ item.date | shortDate }}</time>
                  {% if item.authored_by is defined %}{{ authorshipBadge(item.authored_by, compact=true) }}{% endif %}
                </div>
                {% if item.type == 'quotation' %}
                  <a href="{{ item.url | url }}" class="block no-underline">
                    <p class="editorial-support-compact italic m-0 line-clamp-2">{{ item.original.templateContent | striptags | trim }}</p>
                    <span class="meta-text block mt-1">- {{ item.original.data.author }}</span>
                  </a>
                {% else %}
                  <a href="{{ item.url | url }}" class="editorial-title-link-compact title-hover block no-underline">
                    {{ item.title }}
                  </a>
                  {% if item.summary %}
                    <p class="editorial-support-compact mt-0.5 m-0 line-clamp-2">{{ item.summary }}</p>
                  {% elif item.original and item.original.templateContent %}
                    <p class="editorial-support-compact mt-0.5 m-0 line-clamp-2">{{ item.original.templateContent | striptags | trim | truncate(140) }}</p>
                  {% endif %}
                {% endif %}
              </article>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-newsletter-panel animate-enter stagger-3 not-prose" aria-labelledby="home-newsletter-title">
    <div>
      <p class="home-panel-kicker">Occasional notes</p>
      <h2 id="home-newsletter-title" class="editorial-title-compact mt-1">New writing, sent when it is ready.</h2>
      <p class="editorial-support-compact mt-1">No weekly content treadmill. Just new posts and substantial updates.</p>
    </div>
    <form
      name="newsletter"
      method="POST"
      action="/newsletter/success/"
      data-netlify="true"
      netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
      data-newsletter-form
      data-newsletter-source="homepage"
      data-error-target="#homeNewsletterError"
      class="home-newsletter-form"
    >
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="newsletter">
      <input type="hidden" name="source" value="homepage">
      <input type="hidden" name="consent" value="homepage-subscribe-form">
      <label class="sr-only" for="home-newsletter-bot">Do not fill this out</label>
      <input class="hidden" id="home-newsletter-bot" name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      <label class="sr-only" for="homeNewsletterEmail">Email address</label>
      <input
        id="homeNewsletterEmail"
        name="email"
        type="email"
        autocomplete="email"
        required
        placeholder="you@example.com"
        class="home-newsletter-input accent-field accent-focus"
      >
      <button type="submit" class="accent-button accent-focus home-newsletter-button">
        <span data-submit-label>Subscribe</span>
        <span class="hidden" data-submit-loading>Sending…</span>
      </button>
      <p id="homeNewsletterError" class="hidden home-newsletter-error" data-newsletter-error role="alert">That did not go through. Please try again.</p>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section class="home-quote-panel animate-enter stagger-4">
    <div class="home-panel-head">
      <p class="home-panel-kicker">Quote Of The Day</p>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="home-quote">{{ qotd.quote }}</blockquote>
  </section>
</div>
